pkcs7-windows: load a signing cert from the Windows store (#5965)

Adds pkcs7_windows_read_store: look up a CurrentUser\\MY certificate by
SHA-1 thumbprint and build the same CryptoAPI signer the PFX path uses.
The private key stays in the store; Windows prompts for a PIN if needed.

https://github.com/sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf/issues/5965

---
